{"id":105011592530400,"name":"Build and Kill Zombies","desc":"","path":"/game/105011592530400-build-and-kill-zombies","slug":"105011592530400-build-and-kill-zombies","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-3c91430106f2e0a255c4e2d2f813523d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-a85fc6208f8935027bb33ef1c3dafca5/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":9051,"visitor":0,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-10-03T12:02:46.520Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox","type":"User"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":3,"verifiedCount":2},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Build-and-Kill-Zombies-Auto-Drive-Auto-Roll-Auto-Build-and-Skills-or-No-Key-230577","_id":"6abcb266d1eb9bee1285cab8","title":"Auto Drive, Auto Roll, Auto Build and Skills | No Key","game":{"_id":"6aaad9ff8ff8e91e3c94ad1d","gameId":105011592530400,"name":"Build and Kill Zombies","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-a85fc6208f8935027bb33ef1c3dafca5-1ca966e15934.png","placeId":105011592530400},"features":"Full auto farm for Build and Kill Zombies. Open the panel, switch AUTO on, and it plays the whole loop: it drives your car down the road, rolls both machines, builds better parts into the car and spends the cash on skills.\n\nFEATURES\n- Auto drive with the game's own car physics at about 4x the car's speed (100 studs/s, a speed the server accepts)\n- Drives straight through the rock piles and walls that stop cars (client side) - the record went from 2.68K to 3.23K studs and a run pays +2.2K cash instead of +1.5K\n- Learns where the server corrects the speed and brakes there on the next runs\n- Ends a run as soon as the car stalls - cash is paid live while driving, so nothing is lost\n- Claims Loot Rain and Zeus event crates automatically\n- Auto rolls both machines (rolls are free)\n- Buys only parts that beat what the car already has, and holds a rare upgrade in the machine until you can afford it\n- Builds better parts into the same cell of the car and mounts weapons into free weapon slots\n- Auto skill tree: weapon slots, luck, golden and rainbow rolls, damage\n- Auto redeem codes, quests and offline cash\n- Anti-AFK: the game's own 15-minute idle rejoin is switched off\n\nMOBILE\nWorks on PC and mobile - the panel asks once and scales itself, and it speaks English, German and Russian. Every setting survives a rejoin.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open Build and Kill Zombies\n2. Paste the loader into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nFree and keyless. No Robux purchases are ever touched - Instant Buy, the Starter/Pro/Zeus packs and the offline tripler stay shut.\n\nOpen source, read it before you run it:\nhttps://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/blob/main/games/buildzombies.lua\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","tags":["auto farm","auto drive","auto roll","auto build","no key"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/main/loader.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","verified":false,"profilePicture":"/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png","status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","views":3218,"executes":8046,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":"/images/sb/105011592530400-1790751334905.png","likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-30T06:55:35.176Z","reviewed":{"name":"QueueSpeedDemon","role":"reviewer","roleLabel":"Paid reviewer","at":"2026-10-03T12:02:46.518Z","profile":"/u/QueueSpeedDemon"},"liked":false,"disliked":false,"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6abcb267d1eb9bee1285caba","editBy":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":